SESS MCP server (@sess.si/mcp)

This package is prepared for distribution under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
It contains an independent local stdio MCP server built on the SESS SDK, and a stateless
Streamable HTTP composition of the same tools for a hosting runtime to mount.
The hosted SESS runtime and renderer are not included.

